{"id":"locura","lemma":"locura","pos":"noun","rank":658,"glosses":["madness, craziness","an act of madness (i.e., an act based on a lack of judgement or reasoning; an act causing surprise due to its anomalous nature)","nuts, crazy, insane (translatable as an interjection)"],"ipa":"/loˈkuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"locuras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-locura.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aquello es una locura.","en":"That's crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300741"},{"text":"Esto es una locura.","en":"This is nuts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438294"},{"text":"Me parece una locura.","en":"I think it's crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448157"},{"text":"Creo que es una locura.","en":"I think it's crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448156"},{"text":"Sería una locura que te quedaras.","en":"You'd be crazy to stay.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540929"}]}